<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Offline demo · Prepto</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheet/product.css"><script defer src="/productCommon.js"></script></head><body class="product"><%- include('partials/productNav') %><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><p class="eyebrow">Explore the product safely</p><h1>Try Prepto with a synthetic workspace.</h1><p class="state">OFFLINE DEMO. No real accounts, Firebase or Gemini calls. Feedback and scores are fixed illustrations. Code execution is disabled.</p><section class="hero card"><div><h2>A preparation journey in five minutes</h2><p>Browse 18 coding problems, open a saved interview, compare resume versions and explore your progress.</p><form action="/demo/start" method="post"><button type="submit">Start a private demo workspace</button></form><p class="subtle">No email or password. Each start creates a separate synthetic learner. Use fictional input only; local memory is not a secure store for real documents.</p></div><ol><li>Dashboard: choose a focused activity.</li><li>Question bank → Interviews: save and review an answer.</li><li>Resumes → Job matches: compare versions and fixed sample feedback.</li><li>Coding: save a draft; request simulated feedback.</li><li>Progress → Reports: inspect history and separate coding AI estimates.</li></ol></section><p>Use Exit and clear below to remove the current learner's records. Restart clears all data. Sessions expire after one hour. Older guided tools and real account login are intentionally unavailable in this demo.</p><form action="/demo/exit" method="post"><button class="secondary">Exit and clear this workspace</button></form><a href="/dashboard">Return to an existing demo workspace</a></main></body></html>
